    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1011" root="اكل" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ أَكُولٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُكَلَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكِيلٌ</span></b>  all signify
the same; (K;) i. e. <i>A man who eats much;
[who is a great eater; edacious; voracious;</i>] as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَّالٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

